{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.poster.avif?t=1760382781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.webm?t=1760382781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.mp4?t=1760382781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a Silly Survivors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an adorable but fiercely determined furry fox, armed with\u2026 a flashlight! Your mission is simple: survive hordes of suspiciously silly ghosts who keep trying to get close (and pull some kind of silly stuff). In this battle, light is your main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.poster.avif?t=1760382781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.webm?t=1760382781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/5af14a2b183792e49e4f54c248ca2ae8.mp4?t=1760382781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique protagonist</strong> \u2014 a furry fox. worth it, isn't it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silly ghosts</strong> \u2014 they\u2019re funny, they\u2019re ridiculous, and that\u2019s exactly why they\u2019re twice as dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival gameplay</strong> \u2014 keep your light on, or you\u2019ll meet\u2026 a very strange death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and buffs</strong> \u2014 power up your flashlight, widen its radius, and invent new ways to deal with furry ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> \u2014 you can literally singe furries with your flashlight. What could be better?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077800?t=1760382781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077800?t=1760382781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/318d0f3953e021dce688889048ca800c41084c6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760382781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/318d0f3953e021dce688889048ca800c41084c6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760382781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.poster.avif?t=1760382781\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.webm?t=1760382781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077800/extras/4828dd786a477b5c89f125f0cb70b552.mp4?t=1760382781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8a Silly 